<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 29, 2003 :: Arglar wears a dress!</div><P>As promised, Arglar tanked in a dress with an illusion on if Greylok would do her own Ring War. And I took pictures! </P>
<P>Nice work, as always! Grats Greylok on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Cerdiwan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Sparkley on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Veleria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Antroe on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Leviathaun on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A>&nbsp;and Mahrsan on greed roll of the Earring of the Frozen Skull. </P>
<P><IMG alt=Mwahaha! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/argdress.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some leveling grats, some old, some new!<BR>Grats Tellie on 65 and Arcanist!<BR>Grats Thayet on 63!<BR>Grats Mytee on 60 and Phantasmist!<BR>Grats Kasiryn on 59!<BR>Grats Moordread on 58!<BR>Grats Tidark on 54!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 52! <BR>Grats Leviathuan on 51 and Champion!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 28, 2003 :: Bit more prismatic</div>Another quick run to Sleeper's got us two more pieces of prismatic. Grats Jenrenee on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticclaymore.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Claymore</A> and Lushissx on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticspear.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Spear</A>! <p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 1, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 26, 2003 :: Burrower dead!</div><P>Raihn continued her vigilant bugwatch, and when we didnt' have the folks on to kill Dain we headed down to stare at the bug. Not terribly exciting. However, it did burst from nasty yet mesmerizing larvae state into bugginess late. </P>
<P>Grats Tryder on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/sage_headdress_consciousness.jpg">Sage Headress of Consciousness</A> and Zavitar on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Strands_of_Power.jpg">Strands of Power</A>! Aironexius&nbsp;grabbed the orb this time!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 25, 2003 :: Grats Ckaii on your epic!</div><P>Wonderous led Ckaii and some others to a quick clearing of Fear to get Ckaii his epic blade, finally! I was supposed to take a picture of the sexy paladin, but somehow managed to forget. I'll remedy that later! </P>
<P>Grats Mytee on 57!<BR>Grats Tidark on 51 and Champion!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 23, 2003 :: Klandicar dead</div>Thanks all for making a quick Sunday trip out to Western Wastes, and grats Lentor on your talisman! <p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 25, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 22, 2003 :: Help the Dain, Kill the Dain... we can't decide</div><P>Grats Feskan on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 59!<BR>Grats Morlith and Razillia on 52!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 50!</P>
<P>Colwn's turn was up to get his 10th ring, so we headed down and decimated lots more giants once again. Grats Colwn on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>! Wonderous got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Jenrenee got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Feskan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Yimish got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Divan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A> for greed and Jakr got <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> on greed. </P>
<P>After that, we headed on in to visit the Dain, what with being war buddies and all. Mahrsan and Vorne invited him to a private meeting and we keeled him flawlessly. Grats Ceyria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16177">Dain's Head</A> (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/belt_dwarfslaying.JPG">Belt of Dwarf Slaying</A>), Thayet on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>, Morlith on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A>, and Wonderous saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6736">Aegis of Ice</A> from rotting. </P>
<P>And I got famous pictures of feet! We know how I love feet.. But, as Myschief said, it's hard to get a good battle shot against a shortie. /nods</P>
<P><IMG alt="WOOT! Feet! Eat that, Nibbs!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainfeet.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 21, 2003 :: Back to Sleepers</div><P>Grats Yimish on 60 and Warlord!</P>
<P>Well, back on our Friday night run to Sleeper's Tomb. We twinked out Feskan with an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticspear.jpg">ancient prismatic spear</A> and an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Axe.jpg">ancient prismatic axe!</A> Reide got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sightlessveliumeye.jpg">Sightless Velium Eye</A> and Lush even got both parts to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Chromatic_Gaunts_of_the_ages.jpg">Chromatic Gauntlets of the Ages</A>. Divan&nbsp;got&nbsp;both parts to make a&nbsp;<A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=20624">Chromatic Veil of the Ages</A> as well. Some Premier rotted, though a pair of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Premier_Fist_Wraps_of_Secundae.jpg">fistwraps</A> dropped for Jakr, and I think Colwn was pleased with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/premier_bow_of_secundae.jpg">bow</A>. </P>
<P><IMG alt="The phrase that makes Reide say fuck you!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stmonktrap.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stfinalarb.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>The folks online in Voxxy level ran down and killed Vox before Sleepers. This time was Vahnel, Baxis, Shatta and Dyanna.&nbsp; <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/voxxy.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 20, 2003 :: Klandicar, Rumblecrush and Doomshade provide fun!</div><P>Saw Klandicar up and waving a talisman for Feskan, so we went and took it from him. Grats Fezz!</P>
<P>Wonderous led us to something a little different tonight, crossing dreaded Maiden's Eye to get to the Umbral Planes where he had spotted Rumblecrush up when looking for alternate targets. Had a flawless victory against Rumble and only one guard add which Sonaddor dispatched during the fight while Arglar (aka DORF) tanked the big guy for us. </P>
<P>Grats Lentor on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/etherealsilksleeves.jpg">Ethereal Silk Sleeves</A> and Bearspirit on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/wickedmail.jpg">Wicked Mail</A>. And thanks to folks for passing down loot and more loot. You guys are great, as always. </P>
<P align=center><IMG alt="Let's get ready to ruuuumble!! (couldn't resist)" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/rumble.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>After that, Vorne ran out and pulled lots of dark masters and various other stuff in his way to spawn Doomshade. Then he did a flawless pull of Doom! Well, flawless if you like fighting Doom with half a dozen adds, most unmezzable. /grins In true Capulan style, it was a brawl, and people took the initiative and killed off the unmezzables, the monkeys were mezzed or charmed, and in the end only two of ours had fallen.. Wonderous at the start before the adds were under control, and Arglar when most was dead and Doom was at 2 %. Very fun and very nice work all! </P>
<P>Grats Cimerene on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Bow_Doom.jpg">Bow of Doom</A> and Leviathaun on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Mithral_Edged_short_Sword.jpg">Mithril Edged Short Sword</A>. A <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/rod_of_virtue.jpg">rod of virtue</A> rotted and Lev also got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/BraceletofQuickness.gif">Bracelet of Quickness</A> to upgrade his Hero Bracer. Everyone point and laugh at his gear... he's even wearing a netted kelp hat! </P>
<P align=center><IMG alt="Above the crowd." hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/nibbler/doom.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P align=center><IMG alt=Corpse! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/doom.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Edit by Nibbler: HAHA!&nbsp; Good thing Doom had no feet for you to take pics of!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 24, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=8'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a> <a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a> 9 <a href='news.asp?page=10'>10</a> <a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=10'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
